# SonicBoom golden greedy token stream — test_qwen2_generate (batched
# prefill + decode). SonicBoom's own output, pinned so a token-stream
# change shows up as a diff. Regenerate with:
#     test_qwen2_generate --write-goldens
# The cuda line is device-specific (the device kernels are not
# device-invariant: the decode-attention split-KV grid is sized from the
# SM count), so it is only compared on the device that recorded it.
model DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B-Q4_K_M.gguf
device NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 sm 20 cc 8.6
steps 64
cpu 12095 11 279 6722 315 15344 374 21718 11 279 6722 315 17689 374 24081 11 279 6722 315 6424 374 7148 11 279 6722 315 5616 374 26549 11 279 6722 315 6323 374 81022 11 279 6722 315 9856 374 19846 11 279 6722 315 9625 374 12095 11 279 6722 315 15344 374 21718 11 279 6722 315 17689 374 24081
cuda 12095 11 279 6722 315 9856 374 19846 11 279 6722 315 15344 374 21718 11 279 6722 315 17689 374 24081 11 323 279 6722 315 5616 374 26549 13 1416 358 1366 311 5821 504 12095 311 26549 11 1246 1657 2155 11291 646 358 1896 30 576 11291 646 387 15251 553 264 4771 1380 1817 2436 374 264 3283 11
